ville International airport&quot;,&quot;revealText&quot;:&quot;The move had been mooted before her death, and she said of the idea: 'It does sound like a lot of fun to say: \\&quot;Your flight is departin’ from Nashville’s D Parton.\\&quot;'&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;668813f4-01c1-4087-90cc-4cd889a9a7d7&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Shenandoah Valley Regional airport&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:false},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;68e92031-3f24-4167-b3a3-c993eaa89bef&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Bobson Dugnutt airport&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:false}],&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/140fc5bc215e1f08e1374fec0c9be6c4d159222f/236_103_1681_1344/master/1681.jpg?width=620&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=646561c8d62cbbf0af25786470a8c7d1&quot;,&quot;imageAlt&quot;:&quot;Dolly Parton&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;d616ab92-7717-4e28-a451-5cca739f0c7d&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The European Commission president, Ursula von der Leyen, has invited which country to become the first 'associate member' of the EU?&quot;,&quot;answers&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;16a86d54-309f-4c59-b5da-b84797817e37&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Australia&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:false},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;26776c7a-7b29-4092-9ab8-02ea5c54335a&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Japan&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:false},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;a4c9ca10-f731-4f22-9065-4a00d271c5ad&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Canada&quot;,&quot;revealText&quot;:&quot;Canada's prime minister, Mark Carney, has in turn called for a 'unique alliance' with the EU&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:true},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;0d1da74a-8fe8-4d1e-95c4-4f76d6339b75&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Borduria&quot;,&quot;answerBuckets&quot;:[],&quot;isCorrect&quot;:false}],&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://i.guim.co.uk/img/me