 black labrador holding something red in his mouth\"></fieldset></li>","sentences":[{"en":"6.This week's guest dog is Toby, courtesy of Thursday quizzer Larry Bunt.","zh":null},{"en":"Toby wants to know in which city Celine Dion's first live show in years marked a triumphant, emotional return.","zh":null},{"en":"Tell him …","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li><fieldset><legend><span>7.</span>Who has caused a furore and been accused of sexualising women's sport (pictured in 1908) after appearing naked in a betting advert?</legend><img src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/c591f4d87ad5e7f376c03ab1b5afc1f649f691ea/76_0_1971_1577/master/1971.jpg?width=620&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=48f022f3ce4aa0b4d72fa2c2e30e02c9\" alt=\"Female archers at the 1908 Olympics\"></fieldset></li>","sentences":[{"en":"7.Who has caused a furore and been accused of sexualising women's sport (pictured in 1908) after appearing naked in a betting advert?","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li><fieldset><legend><span>8.</span>Talking of women's sport, who spoiled a good walk by winning the Solheim Cup (pictured) at the weekend?</legend><img src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/9edab8c83e9c0ffc1b849636e0c0f9dbcaea3f87/0_221_2763_2211/master/2763.jpg?width=620&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=b03f97f580673713a39d63d649b3dc59\" alt=\"Solheim Cup\"></fieldset></li>","sentences":[{"en":"8.Talking of women's sport, who spoiled a good walk by winning the Solheim Cup (pictured) at the weekend?","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li><fieldset><legend><span>9.</span>Talking of sport in general, which African nation has U-turned on a decision not to participate in the Duke of Sussex’s Invictus Games over the 'Harry-Meghan [pictured] nonsense'?</legend><img src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/623abe2f60a1b09288f7c0e227332fb8f803c94b/277_15_2117_1693/master/2117.jpg?width=620&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=cf0058180d80c62cb76a4749b3ac66f0\" alt=\"Harry and Meghan\"></fieldset></li>","sentences":[{"en":"9.Talking of sport in ge